    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nVIRTUAL TOUR AVAILABLE BY REQUEST\n\nTo see current offers or place your own offer on this property, please visit SherryFitz.ie and register for your mySherryFitz account.\n\nSherry FitzGerald Ryan Cooper are delighted to present Main Street Upper, Cappawhite, Co. Tipperary (E34 YA32) to the market; a substantial mixed-use property comprising a former commercial premises with residential accommodation overhead, a separate adjoining dwelling (E34 VH21), detached garage and a range of outbuildings, all situated in the centre of Cappawhite Village.\n\nLOCATION\nThe property occupies a prominent position on Main Street Upper in Cappawhite Village. Cappawhite offers a range of local amenities including shops, primary school, church, sporting facilities and community services.\n\nThe property also benefits from convenient access to Tipperary Town, Cashel, Limerick City and Thurles, making it an attractive opportunity for owner occupiers, investors and developers alike.\n\nDESCRIPTION\nThis substantial property comprises two separate buildings extending to approximately 3,322 Sq.Ft. / 308.6 Sq.M. together with a detached garage extending to approximately 743 Sq.Ft. / 69 Sq.M.\n\nBuilding 1 consists of a former commercial premises at ground floor level with residential accommodation overhead. Planning permission was granted on 10th October 2025 for a change of use from commercial to residential accommodation. The approved development provides an opportunity to incorporate the former commercial space into the existing residential accommodation or create additional residential units.\n\nThe first-floor accommodation is currently arranged as a residential apartment, while the ground floor former commercial unit offers significant potential for conversion. Given the size and layout of the building, the property may suit conversion into up to three separate apartments, subject to planning permission.\n\nBuilding 2 comprises a separate residential dwelling located to the left-hand side of the property and accessed independently from Main Street. The dwelling requires refurbishment and may qualify for the Vacant Property Refurbishment Grant and Derelict Property Grant, subject to the purchaser satisfying the relevant terms and conditions of the schemes.\n\nBuilding 1 benefits from side access leading to the rear yard, detached garage and a range of useful outbuildings. The overall property offers considerable flexibility and may suit a variety of uses including owner occupation, rental investment, or further residential development.\n\nThe property is serviced by mains water and mains sewage connections.\n\nACCOMMODATION\nBuilding 1 Former Commercial Premises & Residential Apartment\nAccommodation extends to approximately 2,312 Sq.Ft. / 214.8 Sq.M. and comprises Entrance Porch, Entrance Hall, Former Commercial Unit, Prep Room, Rear Entrance, Utility Room, Cloak Room, and W.C on ground level. First floor includes, Landing, Living / Dining Room, Kitchen, 2 no. Bedrooms and Bathroom.\n\nBuilding 2 Residential Dwelling\nAccommodation extends to approximately 1,010 Sq.Ft. / 93.8 Sq.M. and comprises Entrance Hall, Living Room, Kitchen and 3 no. Bedrooms and W.C.\n\nOutside\nDetached Garage extending to approximately 743 Sq.Ft. / 69 Sq.M.\n\nTotal Floor Area: Approx. 3,322 Sq.Ft. / 308.6 Sq.M.\n\nOccupying a prominent village centre location with extensive accommodation, side access, detached garage and development potential, this property presents a rare opportunity to acquire a versatile property suitable for a variety of residential and investment uses.\n\nA virtual tour link can be supplied on request with actual viewings strictly by appointment. Further enquiries can be made by contacting Sole Selling Agents, Sherry FitzGerald Ryan Cooper in Tipperary Town (062) 85161.\n____________________________________\n\nDisclaimer: These particulars are issued by Sherry FitzGerald Ryan Cooper on the strict understanding that they do not form part of any contract and are provided for guidance purposes only. While every effort has been made to ensure accuracy, no liability is accepted for any errors or omissions. Interested parties should satisfy themselves as to the correctness of the information provided, through inspection or other means. The vendor does not make or give, and neither Sherry FitzGerald Ryan Cooper nor any of its employees has authority to make or give, any representation or warranty in respect of this property. Sherry FitzGerald Ryan Cooper are marketing this property on the basis that all relevant title and certification documents are in place or will be provided by the vendor prior to sale.\n____________________________________"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nBuilding 1 - \n\n\nGround Floor - \n\n\nEntrance Porch - 0.72m x 1.29m\n\n\nShop Floor - 5.52m x 4.46m\nVery spacious unit with laminate flooring\n\nPrep Room - 4.07m x 2.89m\nWith laminate flooring, plumbed for washing machine and cloak room.\n\nUtility Room - 2.43m x 4.46m\nWith laminate wood floor, W.H.B and stroage units\n\nW.C - 2.24m x 0.81m\nWith W.C and W.H.B\n\nRear Entrance - 1.20m x 2.26m\n\n\nFirst Floor - \n\n\nLanding - 1.82m x 2.84m\nWith laminate flooring, decorative wall cladding and fitted storage.\n\nLiving / Dining Room - 3.41m x 4.71m\nSpacious Living / Dining Room with solid fuel stove\n\nKitchen - 1.67m x 3.56m\nFitted kitchen with laminate flooring and plumbed for washing machine.\n\nBedroom 1 - 5.25m x 2.79m\nSpacious front facing Bedroom with laminate flooring and decorative cladding on ceiling.\n\nBedroom 2 - 5.30m x 2.32m\nSpacious rear facing Bedroom with laminate flooring\n\nBathroom - 3.31m x 1.87m\nWith W.C, W.H.B, electric shower, heated towel rail and fitted storage\n\nBuilding 2 - \n\n\nGround Floor - \n\n\nEntrance Hall - 5.92m x 1.19m\n\n\nLiving Room - 5.49m x 4.21m\n\n\nCloakroom - 1.00m x 1.66m\n\n\nKitchen - 2.81m x 2.72m\n\n\nBedroom 1 - 3.88m x 2.19m\n\n\nW.C - 1.57m x 1.19m\n\n\nFirst Floor - \n\n\nLanding - 0.92m x 0.88m\n\n\nBedroom 2 - 3.23m x 5.67m\n\n\nBedroom 3 - 2.11m x 2.59m\n\n\nStorage Room - 2.21m x 2.16m\n\n\nOutside - \n\n\nGarage - 9.37m x 7.38\nVery spacious Garage, with French doors to garden\n\n"
